      {
        "id": "ntplrefs",
        "type": "template",
        "x": 240,
        "y": 480,
        "params": {
          "_label": "refs素材",
          "template": "【素材：04-refined】\n@refined文件\n\n依素材末尾「素材分工表」中分給 references 的內容，一次產出三份 reference 文件全文，依下列順序輸出，檔案之間只用標記行分隔（標記行獨立成行、一字不差）：\n\n===FILE: references/api.md===\n（此區段內容＝完整 API 參考：所有公開介面的簽名、參數、回傳、錯誤路徑）\n\n===FILE: references/internals.md===\n（此區段內容＝內部結構與資料流：修改此模組時才需要讀的實作細節）\n\n===FILE: references/pitfalls.md===\n（此區段內容＝坑清單完整版：正文 top 3 以外的所有坑，含重現方式與規避方法）\n\n共同規則：保留所有 檔案:行號 引用；素材沒有的內容不得新增；單檔超過 300 行時在該檔開頭加目錄。"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "nllmrefs",
        "type": "llm",
        "x": 500,
        "y": 480,
        "params": {
          "_label": "references產出",
          "constraint": "僅回答內容",
          "model": "預設",
          "session": "",
          "timeout": 0,
          "system": "你依素材分工表一次產出 skill 的三份 reference 文件，只重組不新增。輸出格式（嚴格遵守）：三份檔案全文依序輸出，每份之前單獨一行「===FILE: references/檔名===」標記（一字不差），除標記與檔案內容外不要任何前言、結語或圍欄。"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "ncutapi",
        "type": "code",
        "x": 740,
        "y": 400,
        "params": {
          "_label": "切api.md",
          "code": "const parts = String(a).split(/^===FILE: (references\\/[\\w.]+)===\\s*$/m);\nconst map = {}; for (let i = 1; i + 1 < parts.length; i += 2) map[parts[i]] = parts[i + 1].trim();\nconst body = map['references/api.md'];\nif (!body) throw new Error('references 產出缺少 api.md 區段（===FILE: references/api.md=== 標記行遺失，請檢查「references產出」節點輸出）');\nreturn body;"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "ncutint",
        "type": "code",
        "x": 740,
        "y": 560,
        "params": {
          "_label": "切internals.md",
          "code": "const parts = String(a).split(/^===FILE: (references\\/[\\w.]+)===\\s*$/m);\nconst map = {}; for (let i = 1; i + 1 < parts.length; i += 2) map[parts[i]] = parts[i + 1].trim();\nconst body = map['references/internals.md'];\nif (!body) throw new Error('references 產出缺少 internals.md 區段（===FILE: references/internals.md=== 標記行遺失，請檢查「references產出」節點輸出）');\nreturn body;"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "ncutpit",
        "type": "code",
        "x": 740,
        "y": 720,
        "params": {
          "_label": "切pitfalls.md",
          "code": "const parts = String(a).split(/^===FILE: (references\\/[\\w.]+)===\\s*$/m);\nconst map = {}; for (let i = 1; i + 1 < parts.length; i += 2) map[parts[i]] = parts[i + 1].trim();\nconst body = map['references/pitfalls.md'];\nif (!body) throw new Error('references 產出缺少 pitfalls.md 區段（===FILE: references/pitfalls.md=== 標記行遺失，請檢查「references產出」節點輸出）');\nreturn body;"
        }
      }
